#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:5
msgid "Untie slave item"
msgstr "解开奴隶物品"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:7
msgid ""
"Some times is necessary to delete previous work, QElectroTech allows "
"breaking/deleting `links between elements (cross references)`_."
msgstr ""
"有时需要删除之前的作品，QElectroTech允许断/删除 `元素之间的链接(交叉引用) <links between elements (cross"
" references)_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:10
msgid "A `Slave element`_ can be unlinked from a `master element`_ as follow:"
msgstr "A `奴隶元素 <Slave element_>`_ 可以与 `主元件 <master element_>`_ 脱钩如下："

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select the `master element`_ which should be unlinked from the `project "
"collection`_  or from the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"选择与 `元件集合 <master element_>`_ 或 `工作空间 <project collection_>`_ 无关的 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:13
msgid ""
"Right click on the selected `element`_ and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键点击选中的 `元件 <element_>`_ 并选择选项 **编辑元素** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Display`_ the **Cross-reference (Master)** tab from the element editor "
"PopUP window"
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 元素编辑器 PopUP 窗口中的 **Cross- reference (Master)** 标签"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:25
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cross reference tab element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 交叉引用标签元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:27
msgid ""
"Search and select the desired `slave element`_ from the **Element related** "
"table."
msgstr "搜索并选择想要的 `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_ 从 **相关要素** 表单。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:28
msgid ""
"Press the **Untie item** button |icon_untie| to unlink the `slave element`_ "
"from the `master element`_."
msgstr ""
"按 **解绑项** 按钮 |icon_untie| 将 `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_ 与 `主元件 <master "
"element_>`_ 解锁。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:31
msgid "icon_untie"
msgstr "图标"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:29
msgid "Press  **Apply** to accept and save the changes."
msgstr "按 **Apply** 接受并保存更改。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_untie.rst:35
msgid ""
"The `slave element`_ can also be unlinked by right click on the `element`_ "
"and selecting the option **Unlink the item**."
msgstr ""
"`奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_ 也可以通过右键点击 `元件 <element_>`_ 并选择选项 **解链接项目** 而解链接。"
